# solnix-iso-tree.tar.gz -- the unpacked ISO tree, ~150 MB per image and pure build
# output of make-iso-usb.sh. TEN copies were tracked, ~1.1 GB on disk and a 3.19 GiB
# pack, which is why pushes started failing. Same mistake as the committed
# unix-k3.Image, an order of magnitude larger: a regenerable artifact in history that
# also drifts from its source. The .iso and .img beside it were already ignored.
artifacts/install-media/**/solnix-iso-tree.tar.gz
artifacts/install-media/**/boot_archive*
artifacts/install-media/*graphical*.iso
artifacts/install-media/*graphical*.img

